  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Season the chicken thighs with salt, black pepper, cumin, coriander, and paprika.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the air fryer basket and cook the chicken thighs for 10 minutes, or until browned and cooked through.",
    "In a separate pan, sauté the onion, garlic, and ginger over medium heat until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the Jamaican curry powder to the pan and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and cook for another minute.",
    "To assemble the tagine, place the cooked chicken thighs in a large serving bowl and spoon the onion and spice mixture over the top.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve hot."
  ],
